  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add turmeric, red chili powder, and garam masala. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add corn and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Season with salt and lime juice to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve in agave leaves."
